  "summary": "Iraq's online grocery landscape is thin: Carrefour Iraq's website (carrefouriraq.com / carrefour.iq) was unreachable across repeated attempts, Lulu Hypermarket has no Iraq operation, and Miswag/Talabat do not sell loose fresh produce online in Iraq. All usable data came from independent fruit-and-vegetable shops on the Lezzoo delivery marketplace in Erbil (Kurdistan region), covering lettuce, arugula, parsley, coriander, cress, cucumber, bell peppers, zucchini, cherry tomatoes, strawberries, carrot, beetroot and potato; none of the nine Erbil grocers checked stocked spinach, kale, basil, mint, true microgreens/pea shoots/live trays, or edible flowers."
